WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.840
COD settlement: settling with senders: cash collected on delivery minus fees and unpaid shipping.

2
00:00:09.389 --> 00:00:11.580
Look at "Ready to settle".

3
00:00:12.127 --> 00:00:18.310
Click "Create settlement" for each sender; total, deductions and net are calculated.

4
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:22.090
After paying out, click "Mark paid".

5
00:00:22.643 --> 00:00:26.920
Before settling, make sure every driver's cash is recorded.
